## Workflow

1. Confirm **Description** and **Feature Area** present (default Feature Area if omitted: `Agent Workflow`)
2. Classify user **prompt verb** before edits — `review` / bare `@path` → ask-only; `implement` / `update` / `spawn` → agent ([kanban-card-gates.mdc](kanban-card-gates.mdc) §2; Signature: `kanban-prompt-ask-vs-agent`)
3. Resolve **Feature Area** → **Label Paths** + **Label Methods**
4. Fill **Acceptance Criteria** and **Decisions** on the card
5. `todo` → `in-progress` → implement per **Decisions**
6. Staged pytests green; update `docs/feature-areas.yaml` and `docs/` when registry or user docs change
7. Mark **Acceptance Criteria** `[x]` → `review` → user: `done`

## Card Done — lessons learned

When the user says the agent card is **Done** (user moves file to `done/`):

1. Run [kanban-markdown/SKILL.md](../skills/kanban-markdown/SKILL.md) § Card Done — lessons learned capture.
2. Update **≥1 skill** + **≥1 rule** + relevant **`docs/`** / registry.
3. Add **`## Lessons captured (YYYY-MM-DD)`** on the card.
4. Add **`## Forward-looking feedback (YYYY-MM-DD)`** after Lessons captured (Signature:
   `card-done-forward-feedback` — [reference.md](../skills/kanban-markdown/reference.md)
   § Forward-looking feedback: Impact Scope, References, Mitigation on max tier, Importance
   when tied; top-3 in chat on Card Done turn).

## Card Done `artifacts:` — registry yaml

When capturing lessons that reference registry YAML under `docs/` (`lessons-index.yaml`, `feature-areas.yaml`), use an explicit extension on `doc:` (e.g. `doc:lessons-index.yaml`). Extensionless registry stems are skipped by the parser (Signature: `artifacts-doc-yaml-normalize`). See [docs/development.md](../../docs/development.md) § Lessons captured `artifacts:` schema.

## Code edits on agent cards

Python touched by the card must keep lines ≤ **100** characters (`pyproject.toml` `line-length = 100`; pre-commit ruff E501). Wrap strings and split long markdown-in-Python before commit.

## Do not

- Use **Corrective Action** or **Root Cause** (bug/commit-issue sections) on agent cards
- Use **Response** (inquiry section) on agent cards
- Skip **Label Methods** when **Feature Area** is set
- Leave **Decisions** as `TBD` before `in-progress`

